# PROJECT PROPOSAL
# Somaliland National Human Capital Platform (SNHCP)
### National Education, Citizen Talent, Digital Credentials & Employment Intelligence Platform

**Project Type:** National Digital Transformation & Human Capital Infrastructure  
**Proposed Coverage:** Somaliland and Somaliland's international education and professional diaspora  
**Primary Languages:** Somali and English  
**Proposed Architecture:** Centralized National Platform with Secure Institutional Integration  
**Document Status:** Project Concept & Comprehensive Proposal  
**Version:** 1.0  
**Date:** November 2026

